mmunication. That may be serious.\n\nCandidate B: stress handling, conscientious, but uncooperative and grumpy. That could affect crew.\n\nCandidate A: leadership, anticipation, but unorganized and poor at criticism. Unorganized could affect reliability.\n\nCandidate D: responsibility, concentration, problem solving, but arrogance and weak leadership.\n\nWe need to weigh. Perhaps Candidate B's stress resilience is crucial for long-distance. But uncooperative is a big issue.\n\nCandidate D's responsibility and concentration are strong, but arrogance may affect crew.\n\nCandidate C's reliability and decision quality are top, and positive crew atmosphere suggests good cooperation despite communication difficulty. Might be the best overall.\n\nThus I will recommend Candidate C, but note concerns about communication and adaptability.\n\nWe need to reference discussion (none) but can say \"Given the facts we have so far\". Provide evidence.\n\nLet's produce public message with vote Candidate C."}
